1
00:00:03,878 --> 00:00:06,588
(Sheldon:)The entrance to the dungeon
is a moss-covered door.

2
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:09,966
(Sheldon:)You manage to open it
only to find yourseIf face-to-face...

3
00:00:10,135 --> 00:00:13,765
(Sheldon:)...with a hideous,
foul-smelling, moss-covered ogre.

4
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,680
(Sheldon:)What do you do?

5
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:18,309
I say, "Hey, Ma, what's for dinner?"

6
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:23,312
(Sheldon:)Seventeen.

7
00:00:23,481 --> 00:00:26,771
(Sheldon:)The ogre is amused by your joke
and allows you to pass.

8
00:00:28,111 --> 00:00:30,611
(Sheldon:)By the by, I liked it too.

9
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:34,120
(Leonard:)How go the wedding plans, Howard?

10
00:00:34,284 --> 00:00:38,164
Great. Spent five hours last night
at Macy's registering for gifts.

11
00:00:38,329 --> 00:00:42,209
I'm finally gonna have that earthenware
asparagus dish I've always wanted, heh.

12
00:00:42,876 --> 00:00:46,506
(Leonard:)See, this is the good thing about
having a girIfriend 9000 miles away.

13
00:00:46,671 --> 00:00:49,051
(Leonard:)I can spend my nights
doing whatever I want.

14
00:00:49,215 --> 00:00:50,925
(Howard:)Like playing nerd games with us...

15
00:00:51,092 --> 00:00:54,222
(Howard:)...and then taking
a suspiciously long shower?

16
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:58,520
(Leonard:)Maybe.

17
00:01:00,351 --> 00:01:02,561
(Leonard:)We enter the dungeon.

